description	"Kreia

A Jedi Consular who minimizes Lightsaber skills in favor of high Force talent and natural skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Cyan/Blue)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- 8% more damage
-- 35% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (1)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Drain (1) ^3[CS2]
- Grip (2) ^3[CS3]
- Mind Trick (2)
- Absorb (2) ^3[CS4]
- Team Heal (1)
- Lightning (2)
- Blind (1)

^8Attributes:
- Miraluka Vision (2)
- Sense Immunity
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Environmential Protection (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Insight (Stat Viewer)
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (3)
- 40% Faster Hack Rate"